menu "JapaneseTinyAgentLM runtime"

config JTLM_KV_INT8
    bool "INT8 KV cache"
    default n
    help
        Keep the KV cache in int8 with one f32 scale per position and KV
        head (about 0.28x the bytes of the f32 cache). It changes the
        numerics: outputs can differ from the default f32 cache (see
        runtime/host/README.md). The PyTorch reference is
        jtalm.model.transformer.set_kv_int8.

endmenu
